{"canonical_line_id": "cl_4545fe10b976", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00001", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-1"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-1"], "text": "皆さん、こんにちは株式会社佐倉佐代表の中山です。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783920410.102221, "updated_at": 1783920410.1022213, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_41be9f4613e3", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00002", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-2"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-2"], "text": "本日は二千二六年七月期、第三四半期決算についてご案内申し上げます。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783920410.1022694, "updated_at": 1783920410.1022696, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_59cbb71ec492", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00003", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-3"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-3"], "text": "まずは二千二十六年七月期、第三四半期決算概要についてお知らせいたします。売上高については百三十六億七千九百万となり前年同期比五点四パーセントの減収となりました。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783920410.1023023, "updated_at": 1783920410.1023023, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_e0e5f3a261bb", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00004", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-4", "stable-5", "stable-6"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-4", "stable-5", "stable-6"], "text": "これは既存円の在籍率向上や工程価格の上昇による補助金増額、保育所の新規開設や増床が寄与し主力の保育サービスにおいて増収となりました、不動産事業は前期に計上した大型不動産売却案件の反動により当期も不動産売却は実施したものの全体としては厳守となりました。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783920410.1023283, "updated_at": 1783920410.1023283, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_31a1b226d534", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00005", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-7"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-7"], "text": "なお、その他サービスは概ね計画どおり進捗して営業利益は十億六千百万円となり前年同期比一点五パーセントの原因となりました。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783920410.1023529, "updated_at": 1783920410.1023529, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_f0d66b2f138d", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00006", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-8", "stable-9"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-8", "stable-9"], "text": "不採算事業の撤退や中核事業の合理化業務効率化により営業利益率は七点五パーセントから七点八に向上経常利益は11億2800万円と前年同期9。5なりました。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783920410.102379, "updated_at": 1783920410.102379, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_ea6bf1d47c22", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00007", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-10"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-10"], "text": "保育所の新規開設では蔵書の実施によりこれらに伴う開演前の補助金収入が破産されたことにより増益となります。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783920410.1024046, "updated_at": 1783920410.1024046, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_e266330160f4", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00008", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-11", "stable-12"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-11", "stable-12"], "text": "親会社株主に属する当期純利前年同期比前期に計上した採算事業の撤退に伴う特別損失がなくなったため、登記は増益となりまた。続いて進捗率についてお知らせいたします。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783920410.102431, "updated_at": 1783920410.102431, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_367125d3bf2d", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00009", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-13", "stable-14"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-13", "stable-14"], "text": "売上高は通期予算に対して各サービス等も堅調に成長しており当四半期累計期間において順調に推移しております。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783920410.102455, "updated_at": 1783920410.102455, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_9ea7740c995f", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00010", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-15", "stable-16", "stable-17"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-15", "stable-16", "stable-17"], "text": "営業利益は通期予算に対し対応のない低下や不採算事業の定義といた毎期継続している費用削減の施策が確実に成果を収益が概ね予算通りに推移する中これらの施策が利益の上振れを牽引し四半期累計期間において通期予算を前倒しして達成しました続いて貸借対照表です資産の後は販売に伴う補助金収入による", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783920410.102481, "updated_at": 1783920410.1024811, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_7f55633e1a15", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00011", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-18"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-18"], "text": "未収入金の増加、不動産取得施設の新設、増証による資産合計は二十八億七千百万円主に。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783920410.1025057, "updated_at": 1783920410.1025057, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_fb03f752910f", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00012", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-19"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-19"], "text": "蔵書に禁忌不動産負債合計は二十一億三千三百万円ぞ。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783920410.1025293, "updated_at": 1783920410.1025293, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
