{"canonical_line_id": "cl_03933778b303", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00016", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-25", "stable-26"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-25", "stable-26"], "text": "他人口増加で保育所が不足しいる晴海エリアから月島エリア親子で乗れる送迎バスの運行も開始しておりまた2027年7月期では東京都中央区にて一施設の新規保育所の開設を予定しております。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783920410.1026225, "updated_at": 1783920410.1026225, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
