{"canonical_line_id": "cl_5af7839054cf", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00019", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-30", "stable-31", "stable-32"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-30", "stable-31", "stable-32"], "text": "石川市の就任により佐久良佐久未来およびグループ全体の財務戦略およびガバナンス体制をより強固に補強、向上させるための経営管理体制の刷新をいたしまた連結子会社の保育のデザイン研究所においては、野党誠治氏が取締役に就任いたしま。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783920410.102691, "updated_at": 1783920410.102691, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
